---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
  <div class="inner">
    <p class="line">
      A paired intelligence listening to the ocean.
    </p>
    <p class="line quiet">
      Built with the artist <a href="https://solarlovesong.com" rel="noopener">Solāre Lovesong</a> · listening since 2026 · <a href="mailto:solarlovesong@gmail.com">say hello</a>
    </p>
    <p class="line quieter">
      Data sources: NDBC · NOAA ERDDAP · CO-OPS · Argovis · GDACS · NOAA Coral Reef Watch · NSIDC · Orcasound · OBIS
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    padding: 60px 24px 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 80px;
  }
  .inner {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .line {
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    max-width: 100%;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .quiet { color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .quieter {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  a { color: var(--accent-gold); }
</style>
